<title>MEXICO: U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Jan 29.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Jan 29.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Soybean Association updated Tuesday, via its local office, U.S. exports of soybeans to Mexico.</p>
<p>Volumes are in tonnes, accumulated week-on-week for the marketing year Sept 1 - Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Week Ending    Accum Total    Week Ending    Accum Total</p>
<p>    29/11/95	    480,500	29/11/96	   600,700</p>
<p>    06/12/95	    500,700	05/12/96	   687,600</p>
<p>    28/12/95	    665,000	25/12/96	   926,400</p>
<p>    04/01/96	    718,200	02/01/97	   996,200</p>
<p>    24/01/96	    922,000	08/01/97	 1,038,000</p>
<p>    07/02/96	  1,038,000	29/01/97	 1,178,000</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
